/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4864635088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120846#issuecomment-4864635088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120846","id":4864635088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIfRw0A","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T10:18:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T10:18:00Z","body":"The warning does appear as expected with `print(bar.member)` commented, the problem is it doesn't if you uncomment that line, even though `member` is never used (`bar.member` is instead):\n\n<img width=\"1000\" height=\"430\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c6a6c44-4af9-4511-be94-1ec44b700c3e\" />\n<img width=\"1000\" height=\"430\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abb6f0da-6326-4a3d-a658-9fc75003751e\" />\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4864635088/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4866706734","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120846#issuecomment-4866706734","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120846","id":4866706734,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIhQNLg","user":{"login":"mattigu","id":47303532,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzAzNTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47303532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu","html_url":"https://github.com/mattigu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T14:14:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T14:14:12Z","body":"I'm working on this","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4866706734/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4868673768","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120846#issuecomment-4868673768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120846","id":4868673768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIjIQ6A","user":{"login":"mattigu","id":47303532,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzAzNTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47303532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu","html_url":"https://github.com/mattigu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattigu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T17:26:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T08:01:31Z","body":"The problem is how `parse_attribute` calls `parse_identifier`.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/549d1846bdfc0886b4696a1a76f15206364f69b0/modules/gdscript/gdscript_parser.cpp#L3456\n\n`parse_identifier` doesn't know it's parsing a part of subscript chain like `bar.member`. In the code below, `parse_identifier` finds `member` and increments it's usage. This is not correct for assignment like `var member := bar.member` since the part `bar.member` is not real usage.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/549d1846bdfc0886b4696a1a76f15206364f69b0/modules/gdscript/gdscript_parser.cpp#L2872-L2881\n\nEdit: nvm I figured it out\nI'm not sure how to fix this nicely. You can decrement the usage in `parse_attribute` right after calling `parse_identifier`, but that requires looking up the variable and doing a switch again, which is inefficient.\n\nA better alternative would be to make `parse_identifier` aware that it's called from `parse_attribute`. The least invasive fix would be just adding a boolean flag in the parser. Is that fine?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4868673768/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]